# Windsurf Rules

This repository follows the unified instructions defined in AGENTS.md.

## Core Rules

1. Source of truth is AGENTS.md, docs/plans/AGENTS.md, and project.json manifests.
2. Follow the 5-Step Plan Pipeline (`.agents/skills/plan-pipeline/SKILL.md` and `python3 scripts/plan_pipeline.py`) and `./run_tests.sh`.
3. For Word document projects, use the workflow scripts in `.agents/skills/develop-versioned-documents/scripts/` (or `.codex/skills/...`).
3. Maintain stable filenames across builds and releases without appending version numbers.
4. Ensure 100% all-page review and automated QA passes before promoting review builds or releases.
